M104 S0 ; turn off temperature
M140 S0 ; turn off heatbed
M107 ; turn off fan
G1 X241 Y201 F3600 ; park
G1 Z25 F300 ; Move print head up
M73 P99 R0
M73 Q99 S0
G4 ; wait
M572 S0 ; reset PA
M593 X T2 F0 ; disable IS
M593 Y T2 F0 ; disable IS
M84 X Y E ; disable motors
; max_layer_z = 2
M73 P100 R0
M73 Q100 S0
